<title>CANADA: Canada government cash balances - not available.</title>
<headline>Canada government cash balances - not available.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada issued the following data for the week ended December 25, the Bank of Canada said on Friday. Some figures, including cash balances, were unavailable due to technical problems, it said.</p>
<p>				    Wk to Dec 25   Chg on wk Chg on yr</p>
<p>Notes in circulation		  NA	 NA	  NA</p>
<p>Government cash balances	    NA	 NA	  NA</p>
<p>Govt securities outstanding	 464.97   +0.075    +6.564</p>
<p>Treasury bills			  137.70   +0.100   -24.600</p>
<p>Canada savings bonds		   33.45   -0.024   +1.998</p>
<p>All figures in billions of dollars.  </p>
<p>   Chartered bank assets			 Dec	   Nov</p>
<p>   Net foreign currency			NA	    -13.398</p>
<p>   Canadian dollar			     NA	    672.336</p>
<p>   Total Canadian liquid assets	    NA	    109.163</p>
<p>					  Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>M1				     NA	     70.93     62.67</p>
<p>M2				     NA	     396.29   388.642</p>
<p>M3				     NA	     497.23   474.123</p>
<p>Note - Figures are unadjusted, in billions of dollars.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
